    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d334-a1">

                <pb facs="0383" n="371" sameAs="frus:frus1943v02/pg371"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure 1]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Text of message from Former Naval Person
                        </hi><anchor n="92" xml:id="d334-f1"/>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">to President dated September</hi> 21st, 1943</head>
                <p>No. 417 of September 20th.</p>
                <p>I send you in my immediately following message our comments on Eisenhower’s
                    proposals for dealing with Badoglio Government (NAF 409 of September 18th).</p>
                <pb facs="0384" n="372" xml:id="pg372"/>
                <p>If you agree I hope you will instruct Eisenhower accordingly.</p>
                <p>I am informing the Soviet Government of the line I propose we should take. If you
                    agree please back this up. We cannot delay action or hamper Eisenhower in these
                    critical days.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
